<mfmatr><?Pub Dtl>
<transltr>
<title>REVISION TRANSMITTAL LETTER</title>
<para>TO:</para>
<para>Holders of Component Maintenance Manual (CMM) 25-24-19, revision
No. 0, dated Apr 17/08.</para>
<para>GENERAL:</para>
<para>This transmittal letter is attached to the revision No. 1 of
CMM 25-24-19, dated Sep 18/26.</para>
<para>The pages which are changed with this revision are shown in
the List of Effective Pages (LEP). The type of change is shown in
the list as follows:</para>
<deflist>
<defdata><term>R</term><def>This page has been revised (replaced)</def>
</defdata>
<defdata><term>D</term><def>This page has been erased (removed)</def>
</defdata>
<defdata><term>N</term><def>This page is new (put into the CMM)</def>
</defdata>
</deflist>
<para>Make sure that the contents of the CMM agrees with the List
of Effective Pages (LEP).</para>
<para>Write the details on the Record of Revisions (ROR) page.</para>
<para>File this Transmittal Letter in the CMM after the Record of
Temporary Revisions (RTR).</para>
<para>Remove and discard the pages which are changed with this Revision.</para>
<para>REASON FOR ISSUE:</para>
<numlist numtype="nnp">
<numlitem>
<para>Incorporate New Company Name, Logo, Cage Code and Placard part
number.</para>
</numlitem>
<numlitem>
<para>Incorporate New Engineering Changes. Refer to highlights section
for the detailed change descriptions.</para>
</numlitem>
</numlist>
</transltr>
