<pgblk chapnbr="25" sectnbr="24" subjnbr="19" pgblknbr="0" chg="r"
key="pgblk-25-24-19-0" revdate="20260918"><?Pub Dtl>
<chgdesc>Updated to reflect the new logo and name of the company.</chgdesc>
<chgdesc>Updated manufacturer's name.</chgdesc>
<chgdesc>Updated product support services address.</chgdesc>
<chgdesc>Updated abbreviations and units symbols.</chgdesc>
<title>INTRODUCTION</title>
<task chapnbr="25" sectnbr="24" subjnbr="19" func="99F" seq="001"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="0" chg="u"
key="task-25-24-19-99f-001-a01" revdate="20080417">
<title>Scope</title>
<topic>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>This Component Maintenance Manual (CMM) contains
maintenance instructions and lists replacement parts for the First
Class Double Seat Assembly.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>This document agrees with the AIR TRANSPORT
ASSOCIATION of AMERICA, Specification No. 2200 (ATA 2200) and shows
the newest data.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>This manual uses the task and sub task identification
of the Maintenance Task Oriented Support System (MTOSS). The maintenance
tasks and other data have special MTOSS numbers for the use of Electronic
Data Processing (EDP).</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</topic>
</task>
<task chapnbr="25" sectnbr="24" subjnbr="19" func="99F" seq="002"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="0" chg="u"
key="task-25-24-19-99f-002-a01" revdate="20080417">
<title>Product Support Services</title>
<topic>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Replacement parts, technical publications
and other product support services are available from <revst>Safran
Seats USA LLC<revend>. Please contact:</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
