</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Disconnect the actuator guard (505) from
cable assemblies (660).<?Pub _bookmark Command="[Quick Mark]"></para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the recline actuators (510) from trunnion
