<prclist3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the quadrants (10 or -10A and 5) from<?Pub
_bookmark Command="[Quick Mark]"> back pivot brackets (30 and 35)
by removing bolts (15) and washers (20).</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the edge trim neoprene rubber (25)
from back pivot bracket (30).</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the back pivot brackets (35 and 30)
from back seat filler (150) by removing bolts (40) and washers (45).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para><revst>Remove the directional studs (56)
from the back pan (90) by removing rivet (57) and washers (58).<revend></para>
</prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the directional studs (85) from the
back pan (195) by removing rivets (90) and washers (95).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the track stop (60) from slide track
(70) by removing screws (65).</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the slide track (70) from welded back
structure (155) by removing screws (75).</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove the <revst>hook tapes (80 thru -85A<revend>)
from pan back (90) <revst>by removing rivets (-91)<revend>.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Remove spring block assembly (110) and monitor
bracket assemblies (100 and 95) from welded back structure (155) by
