<prcitem3><prcitem><para><revst>Remove the literature pocket spring
(-116) from the spring mount assemblies (50) by removing screws (-117)
and washers (-118).<revend></para></prcitem></prcitem3>
</prclist3>
</prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the cart bumper (560, IPL Figure 1)
from aisle shroud (685) by removing screws (570 and 565).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove  the outboard and aisle hinged arm
trims (580 and 575) and mount tabs (615, 610, 605 and 600) from base
