</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the aisle shroud (685) from aisle
armrest panel (870) by removing screws (690) and washers (695).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the aisle inner shroud (700) and bottom
