<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the outboard shroud (775) from outboard
armrest panel (920) by removing screws (780) and washers (785). </para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the interface bracket assembly (790)
from base frame assembly (1035) by removing rivets (-795).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the forward center shroud (800) from
base frame assembly (1035) by removing screws (805) and washers (810).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the lower shroud (815) from base frame
assembly (1035) by removing screws (820) and washers (825).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the center aft shroud (830) from base
frame assembly (1035) by removing screws (835), washers (840) and
spacers (845).</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the center inner shrouds (855 and
850) from center armrest panels (970 and 965) by removing screws (860)
and washers (865).</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the aisle armrest panel (870) from
base frame assembly (1035) by removing rivets (-885, -880 and -875).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the aisle inner armrest panel (890)
and forward closeout armrest (910) from base frame assembly (1035)
