</prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the outboard armrest panel (920) from
base frame assembly (1035) by removing rivets (-935, -930 and -925).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the outboard inner armrest panel (940)
and forward closeout armrest (955) from base frame assembly (1035)
by removing rivets (-960, -950 and -945).</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the center armrest panels (970 and
965) and forward closeout armrest panel (985) from base frame assembly
