</prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the outboard and aisle foodtable guide
assemblies (1000 and 995) from outboard and aisle inner armrest panels
(940 and 890) by removing rivets (-1005).</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove the outboard and aisle foodtable guide
